  "description": "👑 <strong>Great British Summer Savings applied to dates up until September 1st!</strong> Ticket prices include the temporary VAT reduction, with the full saving passed on to you.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n⭐ <em>Ever watched a TV game show and thought, \"I could totally win that\"? Now is your chance to prove it. Welcome to </em><strong><em>BuzzAttack</em></strong><em>, London’s wildest, most immersive live game show experience where you and your squad are the stars. Step onto a stunning, high-tech set, spin the giant wheel of fate, and battle it out across five main challenges and several mini-games that combine trivia, lightning-fast reflexes, and tactical teamwork. Are you in it to win it? Let's find out...</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n⚡ A fast-paced show combining competition, humour, and adrenaline<br>\r\n🎮 5 iconic TV game-inspired challenges, updated with an innovative twist<br>\r\n🎯 Surprise mini-games that keep everyone on their toes&nbsp;<br>\r\n🎡 A giant wheel determines each challenge, raising the stakes with every spin<br>\r\n✨ Lights, music, and technology make every challenge a fully immersive experience<br>\r\n👨‍👩‍👧 Perfect choice for co-workers, friends, and families<br>\r\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for BuzzAttack: The Live Game Show Experience in London <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/678290\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date and time: select your date and time directly in the ticket selector&nbsp;<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: 60 minutes of gameplay - please <strong>arrive 15 minutes before </strong>your start time<br>\r\n<strong>❗</strong> Please note, <strong>if you arrive 15+ minutes after your start time, you risk losing your slot and not being able to play</strong><br>\r\n📍 Venue: 3A Rosewood Building, Hackney Rd, London E2 8GY, United Kingdom<br>\r\n📏 Requirement: minimum height 4 ft. 3 inches<br>\r\n🧑‍⚖️ Under 16s: an adult must be present on-site, even if not participating<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: this venue is fully accessible<br>\r\n👥 Teams: 4 to 12 players per group, split into teams on-site to compete against each other<br>\r\n🗣️ Experience currently available in Spanish and English<br>\r\n❓ Check the FAQs <a href=\"https://london.buzzattack.games/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Game Programme </strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><strong>5 Main Challenges:</strong> challenges inspired by the biggest TV game shows, combining questions, reflexes, strategy, and team fun.</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Express Surprise Mini-Games:</strong> quick, unexpected challenges interspersed throughout the experience to keep excitement at its peak.</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Multiplier Wheel:</strong> before each mini-game, spin the wheel to determine the round’s point multiplier. One spin can change everything!</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Grand Final: </strong>the final challenge where adrenaline peaks and only the most synchronised team can be crowned champion.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nAt <em>BuzzAttack</em> in London, you and your group will compete in five main challenges plus several mini-games, while the multiplier wheel adds an element of surprise that can turn the game upside down. Amid lights, music, and cutting-edge technology, this is a real-life game show experience where you are the main character. This is your moment. Get your tickets today for <em>BuzzAttack</em> in London!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Quiz Types</strong>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><strong>Original Quiz </strong>captures the spirit of classic TV game shows, featuring general knowledge, music, and intuition challenges in a competitive format suitable for all audiences.</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Rowdy Quiz </strong>retains the game show dynamic but adds dark humor, risqué references, and unexpected twists. Designed for those seeking a more daring experience. <strong>Please note this quiz is not appropriate for those under the age of 18</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>",
